    <briefdescription>
<para>An implementation of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_binary_stream" kindref="compound">BinaryStream</ref> which holds its entire data set in a single contiguous buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>As with <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_binary_byte_stream" kindref="compound">BinaryByteStream</ref>, the mutable version also guarantees that no read operation will ever incur a copy, and similarly it does not own the underlying buffer. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
